      "obs": "On the SkylabModule sheet the keyboard U6 (BBQ10KBD) pin 27 (ROW7) is driven by the global label NET0019, but NET0019 does not appear on any pin of the SKW92A module U8. The other six row lines (ROW1=NET0037, ROW2=NET0035, ROW3=NET0003, ROW4=NET0048, ROW5=NET0015, ROW6=NET0033) and all five column lines (NET0024/0030/0052/0020/0016) do resolve to U8 pins, so only the seventh row is left dangling.",
